Fashion Store Theme
===================

This repository contains two kinds of code, under two notices:

1. New code written for the Fashion Store theme, under the MIT License below.
2. Code from the Shopify Skeleton Theme, on which this theme is built, under
   Shopify's own notice, reproduced unchanged further down.

The fonts in the assets folder have their own licence (see the end of this file).


